所以我认为我们应该和他们分享一下。

58
00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.140
My inner Pam is having a lot of turmoil over these discoveries.
我内心的帕姆对这些发现感到非常纠结。

59
00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.340
Here is how it read.
剧本是这样写的。

60
00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.640
Interior, Stanford Bar.
内景，斯坦福酒吧。

61
00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:51.860
We see Jim and Karen having drinks, sitting on the same side of a small romantic table.
我们看到吉姆和凯伦在喝东西，坐在同一张小巧浪漫的桌子旁。

62
00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:55.420
Jim says, at my old office, I was the one who pulled pranks.
吉姆说，在我以前的办公室，我才是那个搞恶作剧的人。

63
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:56.760
Karen says, really?
凯伦说，真的吗？

64
00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.260
We all think you're so timid.
我们都觉得你很胆小。

65
00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.560
Jim says, wow.
吉姆说，哇。

66
00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.680
Jim's phone buzzes on the table.
吉姆的手机在桌上震动。

67
00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.700
Karen says, who texted you?
凯伦说，谁给你发的短信？

68
00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.960
Jim glances at it, turns off his phone.
吉姆瞥了一眼，关掉了手机。

69
00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.700
Jim says, not important.
吉姆说，不重要。

70
00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:09.660
Karen smiles.
凯伦笑了。

71
00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.060
Jim kisses her.
吉姆吻了她。

72
00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:16.100
He looked at his phone, saw it was Pam, turned it off.
他看了眼手机，发现是帕姆发的，就关掉了。

73
00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:16.520
Wow.
哇。

74
00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.160
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

75
00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:22.860
So, these scenes would really have changed these characters' journeys.
所以，这些场景真的会改变这些角色的旅程。

76
00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:23.640
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

77
00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.520
So, I have to ask, did any of them make it into the superfan version?
所以我得问问，这些场景有出现在超级粉丝版里吗？

78
00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.980
The superfan version does have an extra six minutes of footage, but no.
超级粉丝版确实多了六分钟的镜头，但并没有。

79
00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:38.980
These extra Jim and Karen scenes are not included, probably because Dave Rogers, you know, is steadfast
这些吉姆和凯伦的额外场景没有被收录，可能是因为戴夫·罗杰斯，你知道的，

